  "body": "For some time I didn't get any `prev_content` for `m.room.member` events fetched by pagination. \r\nNow it seems to be back. Not sure what went wrong.\r\n\r\nHow I reproduced: \r\nSent m.room.member event in room followed by 10 message events => the roommember event has prev_content\r\nThen cleared cache which triggered initialSync followed by pagination => the roommember event hasn't prev_content\r\n\r\nServer used: matrix.org, the room is not federated.",
